sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant React as React Dashboard
    participant API as ASP.NET Core API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant AI as Python AI Service
    participant Graph as LangGraph
    participant Agents as Specialist Agents
    participant Model as Own ML Model
    participant LLM as LLM Provider

    User->>React: Select pair + timeframe
    React->>API: POST /api/analysis
    API->>DB: Load market data + memory
    DB-->>API: Context
    API->>AI: AnalysisRequest
    AI->>Graph: Start analysis
    Graph->>Agents: Run market/technical/fundamental analysis
    Agents->>Model: Request prediction/features
    Model-->>Agents: Prediction + probability
    Agents->>LLM: Interpret structured evidence
    LLM-->>Agents: Structured interpretation
    Agents-->>Graph: Agent results
    Graph->>Graph: Risk evaluation
    Graph->>Graph: Decision aggregation
    Graph-->>AI: Structured trading signal
    AI-->>API: AnalysisResponse
    API->>DB: Persist agent runs + signal
    DB-->>API: Signal ID
    API-->>React: Signal + agent results
    React-->>User: Display BUY/SELL/HOLD for review
